## Neon Postgres connection string (Dashboard -> your project -> Connect -> Prisma / pooled connection)
DATABASE_URL="postgresql://user:password@ep-example-12345.eu-central-1.aws.neon.tech/avtopark?sslmode=require"

## NextAuth secret, generate with: node -e "console.log(require('crypto').randomBytes(32).toString('base64'))"
AUTH_SECRET=""

## Telegram bot for GPS/cash/maintenance alerts (see src/lib/telegram.ts) —
## create a bot via @BotFather, then have each person message it (or add it
## to a group) and use https://api.telegram.org/bot<token>/getUpdates to read
## their chat id. TELEGRAM_CHANNEL_ID is optional — a broadcast channel that
## gets a copy of every alert regardless of role.
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=""
TELEGRAM_CHAT_OWNER=""
TELEGRAM_CHAT_MECHANIC=""
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ACCOUNTANT=""
TELEGRAM_CHANNEL_ID=""
